Rate variant   LUT   datapath-activity   dynamic-power(vectorless)
single-rate    330   ~100%               0.070 W
dual-rate      401   ~1e-5 (gated)        0.040 W
multi-rate     438   ~9e-7 (gated)        0.041 W
H1 idle-utilisation gap (multi vs single): ~99.99%  >> 40% threshold -> H1 HOLDS.
The multi-rate scheduler costs +108 LUT (438 vs 330) over the always-on
baseline to buy a ~10^6x reduction in datapath activity factor.

